{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tribute to the old-school cRPG grind, BBS MUDs of the 1990s and early MMORPGs.\u00a0 Developed by a one-man team, Landonia is a single-player, turn-based RPG that includes features of  treasures to loot, level grinding, questing, and class-based progression.\u00a0 \u00a0There are numerous factions that can be allied with or fought against, and NPCs will battle each other if the circumstances arise.\u00a0 Even the characters you create can also interact with each other to help -- or stop -- your other characters from reaching their final goal to become the most powerful adventurers in the land of Landonia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/b52e7810ee73af66ca6f400a362745c94021d1cd.jpg"},{"name":"PRESS_X","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/2984ea5531c67fb8964a0ad693a6e6fb76ba21e8.jpg"},{"name":"Lead a group","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/97862e7aa10f108bfb3c542e19639b6cb5bd6c7c.jpg"},{"name":"Mining","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3394040/85caf1f03b9b85d39faabff52a520a3ac4ac13c6.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394040?t=1740198369","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394040?t=1740198369","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/f33f6aeaf2632c82d06935f2dd62a9a343bd1820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740198369","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394040/f33f6aeaf2632c82d06935f2dd62a9a343bd1820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740198369","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"d